--- !u!114 &709211838757029357
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7439780316587191489}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9730f223aacf44da983e2993a1ae2d2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UI.Cutscene
  _nextFrameAction: {fileID: -6497305991531037818, guid: 35845fe01580c41289b024647b1d1c53, type: 3}
  _skipAction: {fileID: -5035285153872735788, guid: 35845fe01580c41289b024647b1d1c53, type: 3}
  _canvasGroup: {fileID: 315705367068925657}
  _frameImage: {fileID: 8633271788962481455}
  _frameText: {fileID: 6640760135431992029}
  _advanceFramePrompt: {fileID: 4523294094395337959}
  _frames:
  - Sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c45f722296b0b6141b8e8c2d844a3071, type: 3}
    Text: Once there was a flower that brought life to all the kitties of the desert!
  - Sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c62e4bd3d479474fa4e07b71c66cb1c, type: 3}
    Text: But their wonderful plant was too fragile to withstand the dusty storms...
  - Sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 924cce544d63f8a4790ed29f276093e7, type: 3}
    Text: To protect their precious flower, the cats built a temple high above the
      desert...
  - Sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e2d8b9e7db6c35949b3044e2cb66cfca, type: 3}
    Text: Now, every year, two lucky kittens are selected to water the sacred plant.
  - Sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 129e592b34b9f8d4cbb6559d0787518e, type: 3}
    Text: These clumsy cats must be careful! A dangerous journey lies ahead, and
      water is scarce!
  - Sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a04d7e35d5fb8e140a3a05de07314ac0, type: 3}
    Text: If these kittens work together, they can reach the top! Good luck!
